WEBVTT

00:00:00.310 --> 00:00:04.940
Episode 1
 (Wan)

00:00:00.310 --> 00:00:04.940
Bungo 
Stray Dogs

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:07.600
<i>Stray Dogs.</i>

00:00:08.010 --> 00:00:13.790
<i>A pack of lost dogs dashing aimlessly 
through the abyss of Yokohama.</i>

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:32.960
Something terrible is happening.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:32.970
<b>Nakajima Atsushi</b>

00:00:33.570 --> 00:00:35.980
I have to tell Dazai and the others.

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:40.430
<b>Dazai Osamu</b>

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:42.550
I could die if I ate this.

00:00:42.550 --> 00:00:44.810
But I don't want to suffer.

00:00:43.980 --> 00:00:46.190
<b>Please, never 
feed chocolate
 to a dog.</b>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:48.160
Quick! Dazai-san! Kunikida-san!

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:51.380
My glasses...

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:54.110
<b>Kunikida Doppo</b>

00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:54.110
What is it, Atsushi?

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:56.800
Our turf is being invaded!

00:00:56.800 --> 00:00:57.630
Say what?

00:00:57.630 --> 00:01:00.740
The scent in front of <i>the </i>
building has changed.

00:01:00.740 --> 00:01:02.080
<i>The</i> building, huh?

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:04.670
That building used to 
be among our favorites.

00:01:04.670 --> 00:01:08.600
It's a precious feeding ground 
for lost dogs such as us.

00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:09.550
Yes.

00:01:09.740 --> 00:01:12.910
We absolutely cannot allow it 
to be taken by other dogs.

00:01:12.910 --> 00:01:14.180
Let's go, quickly!

00:01:14.180 --> 00:01:15.060
Okay!

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:19.300
It's definitely no longer our turf.

00:01:19.570 --> 00:01:22.330
Yes, I smell danger for sure.

00:01:23.320 --> 00:01:27.470
They're just asking for conflict. 
Who would do this?

00:01:27.470 --> 00:01:29.850
This is our property now.

00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:31.340
Akutagawa!

00:01:30.730 --> 00:01:32.360
<b>Akutagawa 
Ryunosuke</b>

00:01:31.740 --> 00:01:33.510
Begone immediately!

00:01:33.780 --> 00:01:35.990
<b>Nakahara
 Chuuya</b>

00:01:35.110 --> 00:01:35.990
<b>Glare</b>

00:01:35.330 --> 00:01:35.990
<b>Plop</b>

00:01:36.880 --> 00:01:38.370
Nakahara Chuuya?

00:01:38.370 --> 00:01:39.180
What?!

00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:41.120
Do you have a problem?!

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:46.490
We'll have you leave immediately.

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:49.040
<b>Special Arfbility</b>

00:01:46.790 --> 00:01:49.050
Special Arfbility: Ruffshomon!

00:01:47.870 --> 00:01:49.040
<b>Ruffshoumon</b>

00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:53.430
They seem quite intent 
on going to war with us.

00:01:53.430 --> 00:01:54.840
I'll make some weapons!

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:55.680
Y-Yes!

00:01:55.820 --> 00:01:57.810
Doffo Faweff!

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:58.430
<b>Special Ability: 
Doppo Pawet</b>

00:01:58.430 --> 00:01:59.180
<b>Special Arfbility: 
Doppo Pawet</b>

00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:04.680
<i>Kunikida's abili—dammit, arfbility—creates
 whatever he writes in his Doppo Pawet notebook.</i>

00:02:04.930 --> 00:02:06.690
<i>Alas, dogs cannot write.</i>

00:02:07.990 --> 00:02:09.980
Kunikida-san! Don't give up!

00:02:10.580 --> 00:02:12.060
I-I'll handle this!

00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:13.730
Beast Beneath the Hydrant!

00:02:12.310 --> 00:02:14.270
<b>Special Arfbility</b>

00:02:12.560 --> 00:02:14.270
<b>Beast Beneath 
the Hydrant</b>

00:02:18.990 --> 00:02:21.000
You morphed from a dog to a cat, I see.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:21.700
I'm a tiger!

00:02:22.650 --> 00:02:23.790
I don't care.

00:02:23.790 --> 00:02:24.700
Let's go!

00:02:27.110 --> 00:02:28.920
That's enough.

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:29.210
<b>Special 
Arfbility</b>

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:29.210
<b>No Longer 
Hooman</b>

00:02:32.760 --> 00:02:34.080
Dazai-san! Why?

00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:36.370
Why? Well...

00:02:36.370 --> 00:02:38.720
Because it's breakfast time!

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:39.710
Breakfast!

00:02:48.180 --> 00:02:49.730
There are more dogs.

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:50.850
Well, whatever.

00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:53.190
We've been fighting through the night, 
and we're all hungry.

00:02:53.190 --> 00:02:55.420
How about a truce for now?

00:02:55.420 --> 00:02:56.830
V-Very well.

00:02:57.280 --> 00:02:59.720
Jeez, calm down, everyone.

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:01.260
Morning.

00:03:01.260 --> 00:03:02.860
Good morning.

00:03:03.110 --> 00:03:06.200
Looks like they're having 
fun together, as always.

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:10.510
They are.

00:03:12.050 --> 00:03:15.110
<i>Unbeknownst to the Armed Detective Agency,</i>

00:03:15.110 --> 00:03:19.280
<i>there are some lost dogs who 
find success in their lives.</i>

00:03:36.030 --> 00:03:38.350
The wind is smiling.

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:49.410
<b>Episode 2</b>

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:49.410
<b>"What's Inside
 the Locker?"</b>

00:03:47.210 --> 00:03:51.970
Are you upset you've been 
put on cleanup duty, Atsushi-kun?

00:03:51.970 --> 00:03:54.130
Not exactly, but...

00:03:54.130 --> 00:03:58.420
Cleaning up around the Agency 
is a noble task, too.

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:02.190
So, you have to clean up inside 
the members' private lockers, too!

00:04:02.480 --> 00:04:06.690
It kind of sucks, but work is work, right? Whoo!

00:04:06.690 --> 00:04:09.190
Dazai-san won't calm down.

00:04:07.220 --> 00:04:10.640
<b>It is bad manners to open
 someone's private locker.</b>

00:04:10.620 --> 00:04:11.750
Dazai-san!

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:14.580
You can't go around opening 
people's lockers!

00:04:14.580 --> 00:04:16.120
It's their private space!

00:04:16.120 --> 00:04:17.630
You'll get in trouble!

00:04:18.330 --> 00:04:23.270
But the cleaning lady goes in the mens' 
washroom, and that's meant to be private.

00:04:20.640 --> 00:04:22.450
Excuse me!

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:24.840
Eek!

00:04:23.270 --> 00:04:24.810
That's her job!

00:04:24.810 --> 00:04:29.110
Yup, and this is our job today, 
so we can open the lockers.

00:04:29.110 --> 00:04:30.680
Oh, I see!

00:04:30.680 --> 00:04:32.440
Since that's settled...

00:04:32.440 --> 00:04:34.320
N-No, this is definitely wrong!

00:04:34.320 --> 00:04:35.590
Who cares?

00:04:35.590 --> 00:04:38.410
I can't wait to see inside their lockers!

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:40.330
That's refreshingly honest!

00:04:40.330 --> 00:04:42.480
First up...

00:04:42.890 --> 00:04:44.510
Are you sure about this?

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:47.430
<b>Yosano</b>

00:04:53.010 --> 00:04:56.370
Well, then, why don't we start 
with Kunikida-kun's locker?

00:04:56.370 --> 00:04:57.480
I agree.

00:04:59.810 --> 00:05:01.970
I guess this is what I expected.

00:05:01.970 --> 00:05:05.300
Why does he have multiple calendars?

00:05:05.300 --> 00:05:07.800
That's Kunikida-kun for you.

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:09.040
True.

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:15.870
One of these must be one of his 
embarrassing poetry books.

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:16.210
<b>My Ideal</b>

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:16.210
<b>(Secret)</b>

00:05:16.890 --> 00:05:18.770
Jackpot! Check it out.

00:05:18.770 --> 00:05:22.090
"My Ideal..."

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:30.100
"How to Make My Ideal, 
Serious, Hard-Working Dazai."

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:30.100
<b>How to Make My Ideal,
 Serious, Hard-Working Dazai</b>

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:32.330
How wretched!

00:05:32.330 --> 00:05:35.020
As clean-up duty, 
we must be sure to dispose of it.

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:36.860
<i>He's trying to banish it to the darkness!</i>

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:38.520
There we go.

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:39.570
<i>He banished it!</i>

00:05:39.570 --> 00:05:41.110
Cool, onward!

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:42.850
We're still doing this?

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:45.740
<b>Miyazawa</b>

00:05:43.700 --> 00:05:45.420
Kenji-kun's locker.

00:05:49.110 --> 00:05:51.780
<b>Tanizaki (Naomi)</b>

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:51.440
Naomi-san's locker.

00:05:51.530 --> 00:05:54.120
<b>Onii-sama</b>

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:57.920
<b>Izumi</b>

00:05:55.530 --> 00:05:57.570
Ky-Kyouka-chan's locker.

00:05:58.910 --> 00:06:00.650
Tofu topped with bonito flakes?!

00:06:01.050 --> 00:06:03.760
Up next, Rampo-san's locker.

00:06:03.760 --> 00:06:07.340
I have a feeling I know 
what's inside his locker.

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:09.950
We won't know until we find out!

00:06:10.520 --> 00:06:12.170
See? Snacks.

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:13.880
Whaf?

00:06:13.880 --> 00:06:16.600
Whaf fo you fant?

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:18.720
He's part of the package!

00:06:19.100 --> 00:06:22.030
Snacks taste so much better when 
you're in your secret spot.

00:06:22.030 --> 00:06:23.330
Yay!

00:06:22.670 --> 00:06:25.290
You're treating your locker 
like a secret base?

00:06:25.290 --> 00:06:26.810
Hey, are you cleaning?

00:06:26.810 --> 00:06:28.580
Can you throw this out for me?

00:06:29.020 --> 00:06:31.520
Okay, try to stay quiet.

00:06:31.770 --> 00:06:33.240
Bye-bye.

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:33.240
<b>Edogawa</b>

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:37.340
Should we keep going?

00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:38.540
Yeah.

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:44.540
Is it just me, or has the puddle under
 Yosano-sensei's locker bigger than before?

00:06:45.060 --> 00:06:47.830
Do you think this is... blood?

00:06:47.830 --> 00:06:49.870
Why don't we skip this one and move on?

00:06:49.870 --> 00:06:52.010
No, we're here to clean!

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:53.300
We have to wipe it up!

00:06:55.220 --> 00:06:55.740
What's up?

00:06:56.350 --> 00:07:00.070
What if it's really b-blood 
pouring out of the locker?

00:07:00.070 --> 00:07:01.260
I'm scared!

00:07:01.260 --> 00:07:02.270
Fair point!

00:07:02.470 --> 00:07:03.620
Oh, I know!

00:07:03.620 --> 00:07:05.530
How about checking out my locker?

00:07:06.120 --> 00:07:08.690
Aren't you curious to see what's 
inside my locker, Atsushi-kun?

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:12.340
Uh, sure. Part of me is, part of me isn't.

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:13.780
<b>Dazai</b>

00:07:12.340 --> 00:07:13.790
Here we go.

00:07:13.790 --> 00:07:14.380
Tada!

00:07:14.380 --> 00:07:17.170
A Dazai-style Suicide Corner Locker!

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:18.010
Crap!

00:07:18.010 --> 00:07:19.810
I thought so, but that's creepy!

00:07:19.810 --> 00:07:20.440
Gurgle

00:07:19.810 --> 00:07:23.270
Tip it over once you're done using it
and it instantly turns into a coffin!

00:07:23.270 --> 00:07:25.990
Please don't try to sell it to me 
like it's a time-saving product.

00:07:25.990 --> 00:07:29.420
I'm getting bored, aren't you, Atsushi-kun?

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:31.500
You show off your locker, 
and now you're content?!

00:07:31.500 --> 00:07:34.910
Why don't we ditch work 
and go have some anmitsu?

00:07:36.070 --> 00:07:37.180
Good grief.

00:07:38.180 --> 00:07:40.810
<i>At the time, I had no idea...</i>

00:07:41.910 --> 00:07:47.610
<i>that Dazai-san's locker would 
</i>actually<i> become a coffin.</i>

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:52.960
Why is my notebook in the trash?

00:07:53.550 --> 00:07:55.130
Is this Dazai's doing?

00:07:55.130 --> 00:07:56.400
Unforgivable!

00:07:58.910 --> 00:08:01.410
My wine...

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:04.420
<b>Episode 3</b>

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:04.420
<b>"An Unfruitful
 Exchange"</b>

00:08:06.350 --> 00:08:08.410
Welcome back, Akutagawa-senpai.

00:08:08.690 --> 00:08:09.900
Welcome back.

00:08:09.900 --> 00:08:11.420
I'll go make some tea.

00:08:11.990 --> 00:08:12.870
No, thanks.

00:08:14.190 --> 00:08:15.890
I'll bring it right away.

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:18.040
She's not listening.

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:22.070
Pardon me.

00:08:22.570 --> 00:08:24.820
Is Akutagawa home?

00:08:24.820 --> 00:08:25.830
Chuuya-san.

00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:27.280
I have a message.

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:29.460
Thank you for coming.

00:08:28.810 --> 00:08:31.200
I was just passing by.

00:08:33.330 --> 00:08:35.850
<i>We'll need some tea for 
Chuuya-san, too, then.</i>

00:08:35.850 --> 00:08:36.640
Hey.

00:08:37.640 --> 00:08:39.700
Make tea for two.

00:08:39.700 --> 00:08:41.510
Tea for two!

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:47.820
No, I don't mean do the peace sign!

00:08:47.820 --> 00:08:48.790
That's not it!

00:08:49.300 --> 00:08:51.360
Chuuya-san's here!

00:08:51.360 --> 00:08:54.940
Make two cups of tea!

00:08:55.830 --> 00:08:56.930
Did she get that?

00:08:57.710 --> 00:08:59.440
Here you are.

00:08:59.440 --> 00:09:01.540
She didn't get it at all!

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:03.680
And she only brought one youkan!

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:07.810
How are you so gleeful, Higuchi Ichiyo?!

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:10.410
Don't you see Chuuya-san's here?!

00:09:10.410 --> 00:09:11.950
He's not <i>that</i> small!

00:09:12.210 --> 00:09:14.410
Take a good look at Akutagawa-san!

00:09:14.410 --> 00:09:15.610
He's in an uncomfortable situation!

00:09:15.610 --> 00:09:19.450
Akutagawa-san doesn't know what to do with 
the lone set of tea and snacks on the table!

00:09:19.670 --> 00:09:21.330
Chuuya-san's not saying anything, either!

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:22.390
This is awkward!

00:09:22.390 --> 00:09:24.200
This is so awkward!

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:24.750
Please.

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:26.110
Crap!

00:09:24.810 --> 00:09:26.900
Crap!

00:09:26.110 --> 00:09:26.960
Uh, yeah...

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:30.460
This was bound
 to happen

00:09:28.430 --> 00:09:30.460
I know, right? Gin-san.

00:09:30.480 --> 00:09:40.490
Crap!

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:34.070
But one of them still 
hasn't figured it out!

00:09:34.070 --> 00:09:36.650
Quit being shocked, Higuchi Ichiyo!

00:09:36.650 --> 00:09:37.210
Hey...

00:09:37.210 --> 00:09:40.480
What's this? Akutagawa-san's 
finally going to make a move!

00:09:40.480 --> 00:09:42.710
Shut up, already, Tachihara!

00:09:42.710 --> 00:09:44.250
You got yelled at! Serves you right.

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:45.600
Wait, me?!

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:46.920
Be quiet!

00:09:45.620 --> 00:10:02.720
Crap!

00:09:45.620 --> 00:10:09.500
<b>Crap!</b>

00:09:46.920 --> 00:09:49.700
I'm the one that got yelled at?!

00:09:51.600 --> 00:09:52.380
Yes?

00:09:53.830 --> 00:09:54.990
Understood.

00:09:55.620 --> 00:09:58.310
Akutagawa, meet at 
headquarters immediately.

00:09:58.310 --> 00:09:58.860
Yes, sir.

00:09:58.860 --> 00:10:01.330
What a waste of time.

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:04.700
I'll come with you, Akutagawa-senpai.

00:10:05.610 --> 00:10:06.490
Me?!

00:10:06.490 --> 00:10:07.560
Why?!

00:10:07.560 --> 00:10:09.410
Why me?!

00:10:40.390 --> 00:10:43.170
I can eat this, right?

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:45.490
<b></b>Equal shares

00:10:44.690 --> 00:10:45.490
Sure.
